@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Get all orders with default pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### 2. Filter orders by status and area
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=PENDING&area=Bole

### 3. Get the first page of five orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?limit=5&offset=0

### 4. Get the second page of five orders, sorted by area
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?limit=5&offset=5&sort=area

### 5. Invalid limit should return 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?limit=999

### 6. Get pending orders using a query filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=PENDING

### 7. Get orders belonging to restaurant 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/1/orders

### 8. A missing parent restaurant should return 404, not an empty page
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/99/orders

### 9. Update an order status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PREPARING"
}

### 10. An invalid order status should return 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PLAYING"
}

### 11. Delete an existing order (expected 204 with an empty body)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/14

### 12. Delete a missing order (expected 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/999